        ['“Every buyer will want it.”', 'A clear purpose, good condition and good fit make it easier to market.', 'Buyers value offices, workshops and storage differently'],
      ],
    },
    {
      type: 'cards', id: 'records', title: 'Future Confidence Is Stronger When the Improvement Is Easy to Explain', nav: 'Documentation',
